message: "If you use DS-ViRe / tokito-dsvire, please cite this repository and the technical bible until a paper DOI is available."
title: "tokito-dsvire — Datasheet Visual Retrieval (DS-ViRe)"
authors:
  - name: "VtronTokito contributors"
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/VtronTokito/tokito-dsvire"
url: "https://github.com/VtronTokito/tokito-dsvire"
abstract: >-
  Figure-level, vision-first retrieval over semiconductor datasheets
  (pinouts, package drawings, timing graphs, reference circuits), with
  layout-gated indexing, EDA figure ontology, and electrical consistency
  checks. Open specification and upcoming benchmark/implementation.
keywords:
  - document retrieval
  - multimodal retrieval
  - electronics datasheets
  - EDA
  - ColPali
  - visual RAG
  - DS-ViRe
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-08-03"
